        {
          "text": "Lino basinsimi, nkukuti musinsimi Hagai a-Zekariya mwana wa-Ido, bakasinsimina ba-Juda ibakali mucisi ca-Juda amu-Jerusalemu, Baka­ basinsimina muzina lya-Leza wa-Israyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
