        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mbuboobu mbubakatuvwiila, Bakati, Tuli bazike ba-Leza wakujulu awaansi. Tulayaka iŋanda iyakataanguna kuyakwa kalekale, myaka minji yakamana, mwami mupati wa-Israyeli njaakayaka akubamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
